UnionCave_Cave2_Text_PokemaniacSoudaIntro::
	.string "What are you doing here?\p"
	.string "Ah, so you came here to steal\n"
	.string "my precious rare POKéMON, don’t you?\p"
	.string "Well, I’ll never let you have it!$"

UnionCave_Cave2_Text_PokemaniacSoudaDefeat::
	.string "So you didn’t want it?$"

UnionCave_Cave2_Text_PokemaniacSouda::
	.string "You wanted to know where I got\n"
	.string "my LOTAD?\p"
	.string "Sorry but it’s a professional’s secret.$"

UnionCave_Cave2_Text_PokemaniacAndrewIntro::
	.string "Who’s there?\p"
	.string "Leave me and my POKéMON alone!$"

UnionCave_Cave2_Text_PokemaniacAndrewDefeat::
	.string "Go...\n"
	.string "Go away!$"

UnionCave_Cave2_Text_PokemaniacAndrew::
	.string "Just me and my POKéMON. I’m\n"
	.string "delirious with joy.$"

UnionCave_Cave2_Text_PokemaniacCalvinIntro::
	.string "I came all the way here to conduct\n"
	.string "my POKéMON research.\p"
	.string "Let me demonstrate my findings in a\n"
	.string "real battle!$"

UnionCave_Cave2_Text_PokemaniacCalvinDefeat::
	.string "You demonstrated on me!$"

UnionCave_Cave2_Text_PokemaniacCalvin::
	.string "I should compile and announce my\n"
	.string "study findings.\p"
	.string "I might even become famous like\n"
	.string "PROF.ELM.$"

UnionCave_Cave2_Text_HikerPhillipIntro::
	.string "It’s been a while since I last saw\n"
	.string "another person.\p"
	.string "Don’t be shy.\n"
	.string "Let’s battle!$"

UnionCave_Cave2_Text_HikerPhillipDefeat::
	.string "Uurggh...$"

UnionCave_Cave2_Text_HikerPhillip::
	.string "I’ve been lost for a long time...\p"
	.string "I don’t mind it here, but I am\n"
	.string "soooo hungry!$"

UnionCave_Cave2_Text_HikerLeonardIntro::
	.string "What do you know!\n"
	.string "A visitor!$"

UnionCave_Cave2_Text_HikerLeonardDefeat::
	.string "Wahahah! You’re a feisty one!$"

UnionCave_Cave2_Text_HikerLeonard::
	.string "I live down here.\n"
	.string "You can, too, if you’d like.\p"
	.string "There’s plenty of room, you see.$"
